Container and environment files
-------------------------------

The container recipe and the conda environment file in this repository install
the programs above from their own channels. An image built from them contains
all of these packages; whoever distributes such an image must pass on each
package's licence text (the files the packages install, for example
pymsbwt-*.dist-info/licenses/LICENSE and parasail-*.dist-info/COPYING) and the
corresponding source offers for the GPL programs (Bowtie2, EviTEA).
